Author: Timothy Fraser [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Timothy Fraser <tmf77@cornell.edu>
Description: Client package for the Social Infrastructure Scorecard.
    Communicates exclusively through Supabase Auth and PostgREST APIs.
    Supports signup/signin, polygon lookup, request submission (sites
    from Overture Maps open data), scorecard downloads, and account
    management. No direct Plumber API access is required. HTTP goes
    through one internal choke point: 'httr2' on desktop R, or a
    synchronous browser request inside 'webR'.
URL: https://connect.systems-apps.com/r/,
    https://github.com/timothyfraser/socialinfrascorer
